# `results/figures/` — Generated data figures

All data-derived figures are ignored pipeline targets. `light/` is canonical for
print and papers; `dark/` is a generated screen variant. Both must come from the
same code, data, and theme configuration.

Authored schematics belong in `assets/figures/`. A reporting delivery may copy
the exact generated figure it used, but this working output remains regenerable.
See the root [`README.md`](../../README.md) contract.
